    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc01_0210_sister_02",
      "hash64": "0E6C3E1207302992",
      "text": "Egal! Ich hab was mit dir zu besprechen.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc01_0210_sister_03",
      "hash64": "0E6C3F1207302B45",
      "text": "Es geht um die Sache von gestern...\\nDu hast niemandem davon erzählt, oder?[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc01_0210_select_01",
      "hash64": "04F744F15E1EA0FF",
      "text": "Hab ich nicht.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc01_0210_select_02",
      "hash64": "04F745F15E1EA2B2",
      "text": "Wovon redest du?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc01_0210_sister_04",
      "hash64": "0E6C381207301F60",
      "text": "Stimmt das auch? Wenn du mich anlügst,\\nsetzt es was, verstanden?[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc01_0210_sister_05",
      "hash64": "0E6C391207302113",
      "text": "Du weißt schon! Wen wir da getroffen haben!\\nDen On--, den Onkel vom Berg! Äh...\\c\\nAch, du nimmst mich doch nur auf den Arm,\\nganz schön fies von dir![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 149,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc01_0210_sister_06",
      "hash64": "0E6C3A12073022C6",
      "text": "Das Ding, das wir an der Treppe aufgesammelt\\nhaben... Das hast du dabei, oder?[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc01_0210_sister_07",
      "hash64": "0E6C3B1207302479",
      "text": "Mein Opa kennt sich mit alten Legenden aus.\\nAm besten fragen wir ihn um Rat.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc01_0210_sister_08",
      "hash64": "0E6C4412073033C4",
      "text": "Du weißt noch, wo ich wohne, stimmt’s?\\nWir treffen uns dort. Wehe, du trödelst![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc01_0210_sister_09",
      "hash64": "0E6C451207303577",
      "text": "Los, zeigen wir Opa das Ding.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc01_0210_student1_01",
      "hash64": "9ECF9DCC98F6C72D",
      "text": "Ich war erst bei einer Infotafel! Hana ist das total\\negal. Sie hilft kein Stück, verschwindet immer...\\c\\nAber irgendwie mag ich ihre rebellische Seite...\\nSie ist so cool und mysteriös...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 102,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc01_0210_student2_01",
      "hash64": "459ADDB351A5A0BA",
      "text": "Jo ist ziemlich schüchtern, was?\\nAber dir scheint er sich langsam zu öffnen.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc01_0210_student3_01",
      "hash64": "1B1CC9BE9B0E2E6F",
      "text": "Die schwüle Hitze macht mir noch zu schaffen,\\naber an die Käfer-Pokémon hab ich mich\\r\\ninzwischen gewöhnt. Hurra!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc01_0210_caretaker_01",
      "hash64": "03895AFDBDF115D5",
      "text": "Das Maskenfest geht noch eine Weile,\\nalso genieße es nach Herzenslust.[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
